                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                        "entry_id": "70b99ca8-25ad-3d1a-a5a0-39e232cedcb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A diaper or nappy (an absorbent garment worn by a baby, or by someone who is incontinent)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "12f16172-16c1-4783-8779-48b12f19cef5",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "Ms. Deborah Manzer. So when I can only get pampers and their personal things, soap and shampoo, and detergent for their clothes, that $25 is gone, so there is no money for excess food toward the end of the month."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b07319b2-3d22-40bc-a822-4d94fd4df7e7",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "After we landed on the island, I could now see the object Markassie had pointed to—a lone pampers stuck (or frozen?) to the rocks several feet above the high tide mark. A pampers—from where might Hudson Bay’s notoriously whimsical currents have brought it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9e7cc54-263d-4bef-a87e-e93e65bb63a2",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "As I say, we’re both out of work and both of them are still in pampers. So, it’s kind of hard … to … buy pampers for the babies.[…]—Interviewee, Raleigh/Durham, NC"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da854968-5ff2-4f8d-ad2b-3c74cff2e27e",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "A trending video has surfaced online where four men wore pampers to a branch of a new generation bank in Epe, Lagos to withdraw money."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f73e77fa-149b-4cca-8e49-115fc7f59608",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "Nunez knew one of the victims, Richard Dominguez, since he was “in pampers,” his sister told the Daily News on Wednesday."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a91d3a4-9100-4fb6-9dce-add4955e5b1e",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "In fact, most of the young standouts on this Dallas squad were still in pampers when the Cowboys last hoisted the Lombardi Trophy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e79fb113-db79-4772-80d9-4ea48314e68c",
                                "sense_id": "468e2361-0c8e-3300-9811-62e90e19ad1c",
                                "text": "Excited but ignorant children ran helter-skelter, some half naked, some in pampers;[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
